OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being assaulted
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died after a "fatal assault"
OL,6,Fin Dublin, gardai (Irish police) have
OL,7,Fsaid.
OL,9,FHe was found with serious injuries on a
OL,10,Ffootpath at Blackhorse Place in the
OL,11,Fearly hours of Sunday.
OL,13,FHe was brought to the Mater
OL,14,FMisericordiae University Hospital,
OL,15,Fwhere he was pronounced dead.
OL,17,FThe scene of the assault has been
OL,18,Fcordoned off for forensic examination.
